From 9396265280cc95b18d06f99c7f0f0823b3cdc20b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Luke Davis <96660898+UPWRD1@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 04:37:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Replace GNOME with niri + DankMaterialShell, add Steam,
 support three modes

Desktop
- Remove GNOME, SDDM, the noctalia shell and unused stubs.
- Add greetd with the DankMaterialShell greeter (dank-greeter flake).
- Use niri from nixpkgs, configured per user through niri-flake, with
  xwayland-satellite so X11 apps such as Steam work.
- Add DankMaterialShell through its Home Manager module.
- Add Steam, gamemode and gamescope behind me.gaming.enable.

Universality
- me.desktop.enable and me.gaming.enable switches.
- Home modules detect NixOS, nix-darwin or standalone Home Manager.
- Add a nix-darwin host and shared darwin module.
- GUI apps move out of the shared package list.
- Users are listed explicitly per host through `myusers`.
- Override nixos-unified's string experimental-features default.

Simplification
- Tidy configuration.nix, drop removed hardware.opengl.
- Merge zsh settings into shell.nix, silence git signing warning.
- Add README and a `just home` recipe.

Run `nix flake update` after applying, since flake.lock is not included.
